// Descriptions
#org @sText_Desc_TrappersTerritory
Pok\emon cannot switch out.

#org @sText_Desc_Graveyard
All Pok\emon on field gain\nthe Ghost-type.

#org @sText_Desc_ItsRainingHazards
Random hazards appear on the\nbattlefield each turn.

#org @sText_Desc_BallroomBonanza
All Pok\emon get infatuated.

#org @sText_Desc_AbilityNull
All abilities are nullified.

#org @sText_Desc_ChillyWinds
All moves also deal Ice-type damage.

#org @sText_Desc_HealingGrounds
Healing moves restore double HP.

#org @sText_Desc_BizzareTemple
There's a 50% chance to switch\nmoves with the target.

#org @sText_Desc_HotLava
All Pok\emon on field get\nburned, except Fire-types.

#org @sText_Desc_StatRoulette
At the end of each turn, a\nrandom stat is sharply boosted.

#org @sText_Desc_CoffeeFields
Pok\emon can't sleep, and\neither double or half their speed.

#org @sText_Desc_DistortedFury
All Physical moves become Special,\nand vice versa.

#org @sText_Desc_WrongIntuition
Your Pok\emon will use a different\nmove than intended.


#org @sText_Desc_NoInterference
Using an item ends your turn\nand cancels its effect.

#org @sText_Desc_ShatteredDreams
Battle gimmicks fail and end\nyour turn.

#org @sText_Desc_Jackpot
There's a 25% chance to\nland a critical hit.

#org @sText_Desc_BananaPeel
Using a Grass-type move\nforces you to switch out.

#org @sText_Desc_NoHoldsBarred
Fighting-type moves deal\ndouble damage, but less accurate.

#org @sText_Desc_SealedDemon
All moves have double power\nfor that turn.

#org @sText_Desc_BloodPact
If you KO a Pok\emon, you\nlose half your HP.

#org @sText_Desc_SinOfPride
All Dragon-type moves\nbecome Dark-type.

#org @sText_Desc_DetonationDelusion
All moves have a 25% chance\nto turn into Explosion.

#org @sText_Desc_NothingSpecial
Normal-type moves become\na random type.
